di sel penjara.

1504
01:40:31,733 --> 01:40:33,526
- Ya, tapi dari sudut pandang korban...

1505
01:40:33,610 --> 01:40:34,386
- Dengar, Roy?

1506
01:40:34,861 --> 01:40:35,445
- Ron.

1507
